    "summaries": [
      {
        "action_date": "2025-01-16",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Troops Before Politicians Act</strong></p><p>This bill withholds the pay of Members of Congress if active service members of the Armed Forces are not receiving pay, including as a result of a lapse in appropriations (i.e., a government shutdown). The withheld pay of Members must be deposited into an escrow account and released when the military lapse in pay ends.</p>",
        "update_date": "2025-03-11T19:56:12Z"
      }
    ]
